<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>AE-FUNAI Admission Guide</title>

  <!-- Dynamic Page Title -->
  <script>
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
      const year = new Date().getFullYear();
      const nextYear = year + 1;
      const session = `${year}/${nextYear}`;
      document.title = `AE-FUNAI ${session} Admission Application Guide | How to Apply Online`;
      const dateEl = document.querySelector('.date');
      if (dateEl) dateEl.textContent = session;
    });
  </script>

  <!-- SEO Meta Tags -->
  <meta name="description" content="Step-by-step guide on how to apply for AE-FUNAI admission. Learn how to register, pay, and complete your screening application online.">
  <meta name="keywords" content="AE-FUNAI admission, FUNAI application, admission guide, AE-FUNAI screening registration, how to apply for FUNAI">
  <meta name="author" content="AE-FUNAI Admission Portal">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/funai-admission-application-guide">

  <!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="AE-FUNAI Admission Guide">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Detailed steps to apply for AE-FUNAI admission. Portal access, invoice generation, and screening details.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/funai-admission-application-guide">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/images/funai-campus.jpg">

  <!-- Twitter Card -->
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="AE-FUNAI Admission Guide">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Step-by-step instructions for applying to AE-FUNAI. Everything you need to know about admission for this session.">
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/images/funai-campus.jpg">

  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">

  <!-- include header file -->
  <%- include('../includeFolder/_headers.ejs') %>
  <!-- include header file -->
</head>
<body>

  <header class="heading-top">
    <h1>How to Apply for Admission to AE-FUNAI (<span class="date"></span>)</h1>
    <p>Step-by-step guide to online screening registration, requirements, and fee payments.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container my-5">
    <section class="section-txt">
      <p>Follow these steps to apply for admission to Alex Ekwueme Federal University, Ndufu-Alike (AE-FUNAI):</p>

      <ul class="child-ul">
        <li><strong>Step 1: Visit the Official Admission Portal</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Navigate to the AE-FUNAI admission portal and click on "Admission Screening Registration."</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Step 2: Generate Payment Invoice</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Enter your JAMB Registration Number and generate a Remita invoice for the application fee.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Step 3: Make Payment</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Proceed to any commercial bank with your Remita invoice to pay the application fee.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Step 4: Complete the Application Form</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Return to the application portal, enter your JAMB Registration Number, and complete the form with accurate details.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Step 5: Submit and Print Acknowledgement Slip</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>Submit the application and print the acknowledgement slip for your records.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="note my-4">
      <h2 class="text-white">Important Notes:</h2>
      <ul class="text-white">
        <li>Ensure you meet the specific admission requirements for your chosen program.</li>
        <li>Regularly check the AE-FUNAI official website for updates on your admission status and further instructions.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- General Queries Section -->
     <%- include('../includeFolder/_jamb_2.ejs') %>
    <!-- General Queries Section -->

    <section class="section-txt my-4">
      <h2 class="heading">AE-FUNAI Undergraduate Admission Requirements</h2>

      <h3 class="text-color">1. O'Level Requirements:</h3>
      <ul class="child-ul">
        <li>Obtain a minimum of five (5) credit passes in relevant subjects at the Senior Secondary School Certificate Examination (SSCE) or its equivalent.</li>
        <li>The credit passes must include English Language and Mathematics.</li>
        <li>These credits should be obtained at not more than two sittings.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-color">2. UTME (JAMB) Requirements:</h3>
      <ul class="child-ul">
        <li>Achieve an acceptable score in the Unified Tertiary Matriculation Examination (UTME) in subjects relevant to the chosen course of study.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-color">3. Direct Entry Requirements (for 200 Level Admission):</h3>
      <ul class="child-ul">
        <li>In addition to the O'Level requirements, candidates must possess:
          <ul>
            <li>At least two (2) A'Level passes in relevant subjects.</li>
            <li>National Certificate of Education (NCE) or National Diploma (ND) with credit passes.</li>
            <li>A good first degree in another field, where applicable.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="text-color">4. Faculty/Departmental Specific Requirements:</h3>
      <ul class="child-ul">
        <li>Each faculty and department may have additional specific requirements.</li>
        <li>Prospective students should consult the university's official website or contact the admissions office for detailed information on departmental prerequisites.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section-txt my-4">
      <h2 class="heading">FUNAI Acceptance Fee</h2>
      <p>The acceptance fee for newly admitted students at FUNAI is available online:</p>
      <p><a href="https://funai.edu.ng/acceptance-fee" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Click here for details on the acceptance fee</a>.</p>
      <p>Make sure to pay the acceptance fee promptly to secure your admission.</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- hot links...........................///////////// -->
  <%- include('../includeFolder/hot_link_1.ejs') %>
  <%- include('../includeFolder/hot_link_2.ejs') %>
  <!-- hot links...........................///////////// -->

  <!-- footer ......................................... -->
  <script src="js/index.js"></script>
  <%- include('../includeFolder/_footer.ejs') %>
  <!-- footer ......................................... -->
</body>
</html>